      "description": "Your camera photos, right where you want them.\n\nConnect a compatible USB camera or memory card reader, browse your shoot, and choose exactly what to import. FrameDrop brings the original RAW and JPEG files directly into Apple Photos or a folder in Files.\n\nA FOCUSED IMPORT WORKFLOW\n\n• Preview your photos before importing\n• Select individual images or an entire day’s shoot\n• Import RAW, JPEG, or both\n• Save to Apple Photos or Files\n• Follow transfer progress at a glance\n• Keep the originals safely on your camera or memory card\n\nFrameDrop works offline, requires no account, and never deletes anything from your camera or memory card.\n\nSimple, direct, and made for photographers.\n\nCOMPATIBILITY\n\nWorks with compatible USB cameras and memory card readers supported by iPhone, iPad, or Mac. Some setups may require an adapter, a data-capable cable, or a powered USB hub.",
